# GO-2026-5932 targets the legacy golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp packages.
# ShadowDNS and its Go tools do not import them: the runtime uses
# golang.org/x/crypto/ocsp via lego, and nFPM uses the maintained
# github.com/ProtonMail/go-crypto/openpgp implementation.
# Re-check with `go list -deps` when Go dependencies change.
GO-2026-5932
